---
// Client testimonials. `home-section` is a responsive hook (mobile side-padding).
---

<section id="reviews" class="home-section" style="position:relative;z-index:2;background:#efece6;color:#0b0b0c;padding:90px 30px;">
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:50px;">
    <span>(Clients — 07)</span><span>What people say</span>
  </div>
  <h2 data-reveal style="margin:0 0 50px;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(46px,8vw,128px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">What our<br />clients say.</h2>
  <div class="g-2" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;">
    <div data-reveal>
      <div style="font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-weight:700;font-size:60px;color:var(--accent,#ff4612);line-height:0;height:30px;">"</div>
      <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.28;letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:560px;">The website is so beautiful — looks 10 times more premium than our competitors. We started getting direct bookings instead of losing them to Google Maps.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
        <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4612,#7a1e00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:#fff;">NT</div>
        <div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;">Founder</div><div style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">Nandini Travels · Kangra</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;">
      <figure style="margin:0;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);">
        <blockquote style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">Divyansh is amazing with his work. We are glad it worked out so fast and so well.</blockquote>
        <figcaption style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4612,#7a1e00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;color:#fff;">IH</span><span><span style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;">Founder</span><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">InHimalayas</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure style="margin:0;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);">
        <blockquote style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">I did not think it could be achieved without going to e-commerce builders and only using custom code.</blockquote>
        <figcaption style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4612,#7a1e00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;color:#fff;">CZ</span><span><span style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;">Chinki, Founder</span><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">ChinkiZ Knitting Knife · 600K+ subs</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure style="margin:0;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);">
        <blockquote style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">Every other agency said 6 months. Delivered in 7 days.</blockquote>
        <figcaption style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4612,#7a1e00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;color:#fff;">KB</span><span><span style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;">Admin</span><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">Modern K.B.S. · Ladwara</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure style="margin:0;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);">
        <blockquote style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">Exactly what we wanted. I will refer Divyansh within my circle for life.</blockquote>
        <figcaption style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4612,#7a1e00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;color:#fff;">NP</span><span><span style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;">Founder</span><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">North Peak Power Systems</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure style="margin:0;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);">
        <blockquote style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">Incredible — no ordinary agency could have delivered this.</blockquote>
        <figcaption style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4612,#7a1e00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;color:#fff;">RM</span><span><span style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;">Founder</span><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">Redline Studios</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:70px;overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);padding:30px 0;white-space:nowrap;">
    <div style="display:inline-flex;width:max-content;align-items:center;animation:ds-marq 30s linear infinite;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.02em;opacity:.8;">
      <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:60px;padding-right:60px;"><span>✦ InHimalayas</span><span>◆ Dharamshala Tours</span><span>● Redline Studios</span><span>▲ ChinkiZ</span><span>✺ Modern K.B.S.</span><span>◇ Nandini Travels</span><span>■ North Peak</span></span>
      <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:60px;padding-right:60px;"><span>✦ InHimalayas</span><span>◆ Dharamshala Tours</span><span>● Redline Studios</span><span>▲ ChinkiZ</span><span>✺ Modern K.B.S.</span><span>◇ Nandini Travels</span><span>■ North Peak</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
